Package: koompi-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: GPG archive key for koompi-repo
 The public half of the key koompi-repo's Release file is signed with
 (see docs/REPO_POLICY.md §1), so apt trusts koompi-repo without a manual
 key-import step.
